1
00:00:00,169 --> 00:00:01,959
(Sheldon:)Oh, nice job, man-hands.

2
00:00:04,006 --> 00:00:05,296
l didn't break it.

3
00:00:05,508 --> 00:00:07,638
l guess Stuart sold it to me like this.

4
00:00:08,427 --> 00:00:10,257
(Sheldon:)Yes. Yes, he did.

5
00:00:10,471 --> 00:00:13,681
(Sheldon:)That is a perfectly satisfying
and plausible explana...

6
00:00:13,891 --> 00:00:16,731
You know, let's all be mad at Stuart.

7
00:00:16,936 --> 00:00:19,776
l paid a lot for this.
Let's take it over there and show him.

8
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:21,440
(Leonard:)Absolutely.

9
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:25,150
(Spock:)Wait.

10
00:00:28,989 --> 00:00:31,119
(Sheldon:)It was me.

11
00:00:31,325 --> 00:00:33,325
l opened your toy...

12
00:00:33,536 --> 00:00:36,826
(Sheldon:)...discovered it was broken,
and didn't tell you.

13
00:00:38,207 --> 00:00:42,297
- Why would you open mine?
- l didn't. That was a lie.

14
00:00:42,503 --> 00:00:45,133
l opened my own toy...

15
00:00:45,339 --> 00:00:48,429
(Sheldon:)...and it was already broken,
so I switched them.

16
00:00:48,634 --> 00:00:52,724
- Well, you should talk to Stuart.
- l can't, because that was a lie.

17
00:00:54,431 --> 00:01:01,021
(Sheldon:)Yours was broken in an earthquake
and that's a lie.

